      "Log on-die temperature sensors (memss, aoc) separately from chamber air temperature so thermal offsets don't mislead RCA.",
      "Generate SMV1D/SMV2D heatmaps and check Vmin margin vs fused-voltage reference (flagging any unit below the 10% screening threshold)."
