    "q": "39. Design a test matrix to validate DDR stability under voltage and frequency scaling.",
    "whatISay": "I design a 4-dimensional validation matrix covering: (1) DVFS/PF states (min, nominal, max, plus rapid PF-to-PF transitions); (2) Voltage corners (V_nom, V_min −5%/−10%, V_max +5%); (3) Temperature corners (cold −10 °C, room 25 °C, hot 85–105 °C T-Case); and (4) Memory stress patterns (memtester dvfs, random, checkerboard, solid, walking-1s), recording Pass/Fail, ZQCal codes, interrupt flags, and 2D SMV1D/SMV2D eye margins.",
