      "Step 2 (Hold window): T_hold is the minimum time D must remain unchanged after the clock edge while the clock switches off the input transmission gate and closes the feedback latch.",
      "Step 3 (Compare race conditions): Setup checks that the NEXT cycle’s data arrives in time (same edge + 1 period); Hold checks that the NEW data does NOT race through fast paths and corrupt the CURRENT cycle being latched (same edge!).",
