    "question": "A Linux SLT driver fails to read PMIC telemetry with `-ETIMEDOUT` / `Arbitration Lost`. On the oscilloscope, `SCL` sits HIGH at 1.8 V while `SDA` is jammed SOLID LOW at 0.05 V! What caused it and how do you clear or trace it?",
