    "visualParams": {
      "clkFreq": "100/400 kHz I2C",
      "fault": "9-Clock Bus Recovery Sequence"
    },
    "lesson": "A previous CPU reset or hot-plug aborted an I2C read right while the target slave was driving a `0` data bit on `SDA`! Because I2C has no separate hardware reset line, the slave state machine stays stuck driving `SDA` LOW until it sees up to 9 extra `SCL` clocks + a `STOP` condition!",
    "formula": "Hung SDA Low -> Toggle 9x SCL Clocks Until SDA Releases -> Issue STOP (SCL=1, SDA 0->1)",
