    "kind": "concept",
    "question": "Your JTAG debugger fails to scan `IDCODE` on an SLT load board: shifting returns `0xFFFFFFFF` (all 1s) or `0x00000000` (all 0s). How do you diagnose each case cleanly using scope + multimeter?",
