    "visualParams": {
      "highlight": "Multi-TAP Daisy Chain",
      "fault": "TDO Stuck All-1s or All-0s"
    },
    "lesson": "`0xFFFFFFFF` means `TDO` is open/un-driven pulled up to Vdd (broken chain, missing board jumper, DUT still in Reset, or wrong VTREF); `0x00000000` means `TDO` or `TCK`/`TMS` is dead-shorted low, `TRST#` is held active low forcing TAP reset, or target chip is unpowered!",
