      "Step 7 (True clean fix): Move BMC I2C handling to DMA / hardware FIFO / pre-buffered shadow RAM so BMC stretch stays < 50 µs instead of 35 ms!",
      "Step 8 (Regression test): Blast continuous concurrent 400 kHz SMBus traffic while hammering BMC with worst-case interrupts for 1 hour with zero NACKs."
