      "Step 2 (Bandwidth rule for square/digital clocks!): Look at **Rise Time `t_r`**, NOT clock repetition rate—square waves carry crucial odd harmonics (`3f, 5f, 7f`). Use `f_BW >= 0.45 / t_r` (or `>= 5 * F_clk` for sharp edges!).",
