      "Step 5 (Use `Max-Hold` Peak Trace vs `Average`!): Set Trace 1 `Clear/Write` and Trace 2 `Max-Hold` while running intermittent workload bursts to catch fleeting burst EMI.",
      "Step 6 (Pinpoint physical aggressor): Move H-probe mm-by-mm across VRM inductors, REFCLK crystal, and load-board cables watching target spur peak rise/fall in dBm."
