    "question": "Running mixed CUDA + PCIe traffic on an SLT host, the server abruptly panics with `Hardware Error: Machine Check Exception` (`MCE` / `Fatal AER Completion Timeout` on GPU BDF!). Walk step-by-step through diagnosing whether the GPU internally hung, PCIe RX lost the `CplD` packet on the wire, or driver accessed a power-gated BAR.",
