    "lesson": "A **Completion Timeout (`CTO`)** means CPU/Host sent a Non-Posted `Memory Read` TLP to the GPU and waited `~50 ms` without receiving the `Completion with Data (CplD)` back! Either (1) GPU internal fabric/clock hung or reset itself (`RTD3/FLR/thermal`) BEFORE answering, (2) a silent wire CRC dropped `CplD` and link died, or (3) driver queried an unpowered/sleeping (`D3cold`) device without waking it first!",
    "formula": "Non-Posted Read Unanswered (~50 ms) => PCIe CTO => Triggers Host MCE / Fatal Panic!",
