      "Step 2 (Use Named Capture Groups `(?P<...>)`): Makes code self-documenting and immune to group re-ordering inside complex patterns (`m.groupdict()` maps cleanly to JSON!).",
      "Step 3 (Handle ALL numeric edge cases explicitly!): Support signed floats (`[-+]?d+(?:.d+)?`), optional `0x` hex (`(?:0x)?[0-9a-fA-F]+`), and scientific notation if present (`[eE][-+]?d+`), plus non-greedy `.*?` between key-value fields!",
