      "Step 6 (Guard 8-bit vs 12-bit/16-bit scope difference!): Note newer 12-bit HD scopes NEED `WORD` (2-byte `int16`)—using legacy `BYTE` (`8-bit`) silently throws away the 4 extra precision bits you paid for!"
