    "question": "Inside Advantest V93000 / DFT testing, distinguish: (1) **Stuck-At** vs **Transition-Delay (At-Speed)** ATPG scan (`and Launch-on-Capture LOC vs Launch-on-Shift LOS`), and (2) **MBIST** March algorithms (`March C-`) for SRAM.",
