      "Step 3 (Distinguish **`ICL`** vs **`PDL`** cleanly): **`ICL`** maps structural hierarchy (ports, SIBs, register bit widths); **`PDL`** writes tool-agnostic `iWrite/iRead/iApply` procedural logic targeting local IP registers regardless of how deeply buried that IP sits in the SoC!",
