      "Step 5 (Classic IJTAG Debug Bug on Bench — **Stale / Forgotten Open SIB (`Chain Mismatch`!)**): If an aborted earlier script crashed leaving `SIB_7 = 1` open while Script 2 resets assumptions assuming `ALL SIBs CLOSED (`0`)` -> every downstream register shifts wrong by `48 bits` cleanly!! Always force full IJTAG `TRST/Idle-Reset` closing ALL SIBs before running scripts!",
      "Step 6 (Use IJTAG Power in SLT!): Query on-die Process Ring Oscillators (`RO`), Droop Detectors, and L2 Repair telemetry straight inside SLT diagnostics using IJTAG cleanly.",
